{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find and grab an object. If not visible, scan area. Move to location, check properties, do task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
